<title>USA: Ralcorp Holdings Inc Q2 March 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Ralcorp Holdings Inc Q2 March 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $15.47		    $0.64</p>
<p> Net			510,400		   21,200</p>
<p> Revs		     161,400		  277,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  33,000		   33,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $15.91		    $1.09</p>
<p> Net			523,500		   35,900</p>
<p> Revs		     454,300		  572,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,900		   33,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 earnings include one-time pretax restructuring charge of $18.4 million related to sale of branded cereal and snack business to General Mills Inc ; one-time tax-free gain of $516.5 million on sale of cereal and snack business; and equity earnings of $10.5 million representing interest in Vail Resorts Inc, shares of which were sold in qtr.</p>
<p>1996 Q2 earnings include one-time pretax gain of $900,000 on sale of promotional fulfillment and coupon management unit.</p>
<p>1997 and 1996 6-mos earnings are pro forma as if Vail and General Mills transactions were completed as of beginnings of those periods.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
